# echo_emac_tcm_buf_en_desc_off

Enables TCM buffer allocation but disables TCM descriptor allocation on both emac0 and emac1 TX
channels. Buffers are placed in TCM; descriptors remain in DDR.

## emac0 TX
- TCM buffer: enabled
- TCM descriptor: disabled
- TCM ring size: 32–64

## emac1 TX
- TCM buffer: enabled
- TCM descriptor: disabled
- TCM ring size: 32–64
